<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30257" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκεντ-ρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				427
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>goad</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				6.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				40
			</span></i>; also, <i>spur</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>pointed stile</i> for writing, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>spike worn on the leg</i> for climbing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιθέμενον . . ἐγκεντ ρίδας ἀναδραμεῖν
					εἰς τοὺς τοίχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					84
				</span></i>
			.</div>
